# The files that go into the Cornerstone API image. The build context is the repo root, so the list starts empty.
# The image keeps the workspace files, the lock file, the source of the pipeline, the league package, and the API,
# the deploy script, the values of the CPC client, and the tracked data of the client and the NFL as the seed.
# Docker reads this file because it sits beside apps/api/Dockerfile.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps/pipeline/pyproject.toml
!apps/pipeline/README.md
!apps/pipeline/src
!packages/league/python/pyproject.toml
!packages/league/python/src
!clients/cpc
!data/nfl
!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/src
!apps/api/deploy
data/nfl/cache
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
